# A previous owner of the domain left /html/en/welcome/ in search indexes; must precede the rules below (rules match top-down).
/html/*    /    301

# The per-game and admin screens have no file of their own: serve the empty
# SPA shell (dist/spa-shell.html, written by scripts/prerender.mjs) and let the
# router draw the screen. Every public page is a real file (index.html,
# how-to-play.html, join.html, ...), which Pages serves before any rule here.
# There is deliberately no /* catch-all: any other URL gets dist/404.html with
# a real 404 status, so a missing page is never a soft 200 to search engines.
# A new client-side route with a URL parameter needs its line here.
/join/*           /spa-shell   200
/team/*           /spa-shell   200
/manager/game/*   /spa-shell   200
/display/*        /spa-shell   200
/admin/*          /spa-shell   200
